    "title": "Customize with StyleX",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text": "Astryx components support various styling solutions, from plain CSS and `className` to Tailwind and CSS-in-JS. See `astryx docs styling` for the full guide. Astryx also has a deep integration with [StyleX](https://stylexjs.com/), an atomic CSS-in-JS library: create styles with `stylex.create()` and pass them to components with the `xstyle` prop."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "tsx",
        "code": "import * as stylex from '@stylexjs/stylex';\n\nconst overrides = stylex.create({\n  save: { alignSelf: 'flex-end', marginTop: 16 },\n});\n\n<Button label=\"Save\" xstyle={overrides.save} />",
        "label": "Style overrides"
      }
    ],
